# Project Name: ZauberCMS

ZauberCMS is a modern CMS using Blazor for the front and back end. It's functionality is similar to Umbraco, with the only difference being that it's built entirely in Blazor.

The front end of this CMS is built using the new Static server-side rendering (static SSR), and the admin is built using Interactive Server Side rendering.  When I say admin, I refer to any page served within the /admin/* url structure.

Always check the codebase and current structure before adding new things

